2005 (3a)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-sintesi-risultati-2005.pdf\">Risultati 2005</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-comunicato-stampa-2005.pdf\">Comunicato stampa 2005</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>Indagine Laureati 2004 (2a)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-sintesi-risultati-2004.pdf\">Risultati 2004</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-comunicato-stampa-2004.pdf\">Comunicato stampa 2004</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>Indagine Laureati 2002 (1a)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-sintesi-risultati-2002.pdf\">Risultati 2002</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-comunicato-stampa-2002.pdf\">Comunicato stampa 2002</a></li> </ul>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Area alumni","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni"},{"label":"Il mio profilo Alumni","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/my-alumni/profilo"},{"label":"La mia Career Story","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/my-alumni/la-mia-career-story"},{"label":"Benefici","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/my-alumni/benefici"},{"label":"Il mio Chapter","href":"/it/originalnode/8951"},{"label":"Calendario Alumni","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/eventi/calendario-alumni"},{"label":"Alumni Talks","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/digital-talks"},{"label":"Visiting Alumni","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/visiting-alumni"},{"label":"Chapter Meetings","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/chapter-meetings"},{"label":"Reunions","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/reunions"},{"label":"Dati e cifre","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/ritratti/i-laureati-usi"},{"label":